# Copy to /etc/squarehole/reveal.env on the server, root:root 0600; edit privately. Compose reads raw values.
SH_SERVICE_ENABLED=0
SH_SERVICE_MODE=dry-run
SH_SERVICE_ALLOW_MAINNET=0
SH_REVEAL_CHAIN_ID=11155111
# V2 posting: set SH_REVEAL_COLLECTIONS to a JSON array (raw env value, no outer shell quotes).
# Each row has exactly collection (lowercase address), fromBlock (decimal deployment block), revealFile.
# Example shape, replace both address/block placeholders before enabling:
# SH_REVEAL_COLLECTIONS=[{"collection":"<collection-address>","fromBlock":"<deployment-block>","revealFile":"/etc/squarehole/reveal/first-reveal.json"},{"collection":"<second-address>","fromBlock":"<deployment-block>","revealFile":"/etc/squarehole/reveal/second-reveal.json"}]
# At most 16 collections / 20,000 items in total. This mode is Sepolia-only, Amsterdam.
# Files are unchanged Create page "Save reveal file" JSON, NOT the public Download BoxSpec file.
# Reveal files and signer key: UID 1000, exact mode 0600, single-link regular files, no symlink ancestors.
# Only paths under /etc/squarehole or /state are accepted; Compose mounts this service's subdirectory.
# Never put these files in the repository, build context, image, public art folder or logs.
# Live requires a DEDICATED gas wallet; dry-run needs only its public lowercase address and never opens its key.
# SH_REVEAL_ADDRESS=<public-signer-address>
# SH_REVEAL_KEY_FILE=/etc/squarehole/reveal/gas.key
# RPC may contain credentials; set it privately. No private key or salt is an env value.
# SH_REVEAL_RPC_URL=<trusted-https-rpc>
# Set explicit reviewed limits (raw decimal wei / gas / transaction count). Fee ceiling cannot exceed 3 gwei.
# SH_REVEAL_DAILY_BUDGET_WEI=<approved-daily-gas-budget>
# SH_REVEAL_MAX_FEE_PER_GAS=3000000000
# SH_REVEAL_PRIORITY_FEE_WEI=100000000
# SH_REVEAL_MAX_TX_PER_BLOCK=4
# SH_REVEAL_TRANSACTION_GAS_CAP=16777216
# Journals: /state/reveal-v2/state.json or /state/reveal-v2-dry/state.json (directories 0700).
# Leave SH_REVEAL_COLLECTIONS unset to retain the legacy Box 0 pin worker below.
# Required before enabling: SH_REVEAL_COLLECTION, SH_REVEAL_FROM_BLOCK, SH_REVEAL_RPC_URL.
# Live pinning also needs SH_REVEAL_KUBO_API, SH_REVEAL_PINATA_ACCOUNT, SH_REVEAL_PINATA_JWT,
# and optionally SH_REVEAL_KUBO_TOKEN / SH_REVEAL_GATEWAY (see docs/runbooks/reveal-pin.md).
# Fixed mount paths: commitment /run/service-config/commitment.json, private renders /art;
# feeds /state/feed.dry.json or /state/feed.json, each with a .work checkpoint; pins /state/pins.json.
# Keep each feed + .work + pins together on backup/restore. See the server runbook for migration.
